<% content_for :meta_title, "Partnership Opportunities with GetCourt" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Partnership opportunities with GetCourt for online court booking, integrations, and sports brand advertising." %>

<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-6">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border p-6 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Partnership Opportunities for Courts and Sports Brands</h1>

    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
      If you want to launch online booking for your court through GetCourt, email us at
      <a href="mailto:denisdenis9331@gmail.com?subject=GetCourt%20Partnership"
         class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">denisdenis9331@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1">Booking options</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
        <li>Lead forwarding: we send your company a booking request in Telegram, email, or another social network or messenger with the player and requested date/time.</li>
        <li>Slot-based flow: if you provide available slots, your company receives the same request details plus a specific free slot selected by the player.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1">Other collaboration ideas</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
        <li>Integration ideas, including equipment analytics or other statistics.</li>
        <li>Advertising in GetCourt for sports and tennis brands only.</li>
        <li>Any other partnership idea you would like to discuss.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
